    `INT_EQUAL` / `INT_NOTEQUAL` is paired with the count word compared in the
    same block or in the branch of the one block that leads to it, when the
    two compared values are one string's two words (a call takes them as
    consecutive inputs).

    Fixture `macho_swift_strcmp_arm64` (arm64 Mach-O, swiftc 6.4.2 -O,
    stripped; source `macho_swift_strcmp.swift`): 0x100000778 `model`, three
